OL,5,G2145 The Essay: Solo
OL,6,     FA soloist prepares to play a
OL,7,     Fcelebrated piece of classical
OL,8,     Frepertoire. Pianist Mishka Rushdie
OL,9,     FMomen rehearses Beethoven's
OL,10,     FMoonlight Sonata.
OL,11,G2200 Late Junction
OL,12,     FIn a programme first broadcast in
OL,13,     F2023, Verity Sharp shares a
OL,14,     Fmixtape from stand-up comedian and
OL,15,     Frecord producer James Acaster.
OL,16,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,17,     FTonight, on the eve of Halloween,
OL,18,     FJumoke Fashola welcomes her guest,
OL,19,     FLeeds based composer and
OL,20,     Fbandleader Fergus Quill. He has
OL,21,     Fcurated a special mixtape of
OL,22,     Fbone-chilling tracks.
